ade the earth a container","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"77:26","t":"Of the living and the dead?","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"77:27","t":"And We placed therein lofty, firmly set mountains and have given you to drink sweet water.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"77:28","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"77:29","t":"[They will be told], \"Proceed to that which you used to deny.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"77:30","t":"Proceed to a shadow [of smoke] having three columns.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"77:31","t":"[But having] no cool shade and availing not against the flame.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"77:32","t":"Indeed, it throws sparks [as huge] as a fortress,","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"77:33","t":"As if they were yellowish [black] camels.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"77:34","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"77:35","t":"This is a Day they will not speak,","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":35,"sd":null},{"k":"77:36","t":"Nor will it be permitted for them to make an excuse.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":36,"sd":null},{"k":"77:37","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":37,"sd":null},{"k":"77:38","t":"This is the Day of Judgement; We will have assembled you and the former peoples.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":38,"sd":null},{"k":"77:39","t":"So if you have a plan, then plan against Me.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":39,"sd":null},{"k":"77:40","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":40,"sd":null},{"k":"77:41","t":"Indeed, the righteous will be among shades and springs","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":41,"sd":null},{"k":"77:42","t":"And fruits from whatever they desire,","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":42,"sd":null},{"k":"77:43","t":"[Being told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you used to do.\"","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":43,"sd":null},{"k":"77:44","t":"Indeed, We thus reward the doers of good.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":44,"sd":null},{"k":"77:45","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"77:46","t":"[O disbelievers], eat and enjoy yourselves a little; indeed, you are criminals.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"77:47","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"77:48","t":"And when it is said to them, \"Bow [in prayer],\" they do not bow.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"77:49","t":"Woe, that Day, to the deniers.","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"77:50","t":"Then in what statement after it [i.e., the Qur’ān] will they believe?","j":29,"h":58,"s":77,"a":50,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":58,"surahs":[77],"sajdah":false}